        <rdf:value>&lt;div data-schema-version=&quot;9&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;the performance of the RNAP is strongly dependent on its&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;interaction with the alarmone ppGpp playing a pivotal role in&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;controlling growth rate in both minimal and rich media&lt;/p&gt;
