    <bib:Memo rdf:about="#item_421">
        <rdf:value>&lt;div data-schema-version=&quot;9&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;compensatory mutations could be why s531L is the most common rpoB mutation in TB. Another reason could also be that only one codon change is required &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;</rdf:value>
